The '''Headless Horseman''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Boss}} spawned by using the {{Item|Horseman's Candle}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Headless Horseman''' is spawned when a {{Item|Horseman's Candle}} is used under valid conditions. Horseman's Candles can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} for {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=32}}.

The Candle must be used under valid conditions in order to spawn the boss: 

*It must be nighttime (7pm - 5am).
* It must be used in the {{zone|Graveyard}} or {{zone|Wilderness}} on the [[Hub Island]].

=== Stranded Mode ===
The '''Headless Horseman''' can be spawned on the {{zone|Private Island}} instead.

== Behavior ==
The '''Headless Horseman''' constantly attacks the nearest player rapidly, dealing lots of damage. It also possesses two abilities:

* '''Headless Zombie Swarm''': Summons a horde of 4 baby {{MobSprite|Headless Zombie}}s with {{Stat|Health|20,000}} each. They will attack the nearest player.
* '''Bat Swarm''': Summons a horde of [[Bat (Headless Horseman)|Bats]] which throw {{PotionLink|Damage II}} and {{PotionLink|Wounded II}} potions at nearby players. The {{PotionLink|Damage II}} potions deal {{Stat|damage|10}} and {{PotionLink|Wounded II}} potions reduce [[Healing]] by {{Green|50%}} for 1 minute.

The Headless Horseman cannot be damaged by [[Arrows]] and the {{Item|Bonemerang}}. Attempting to damage it with a projectile will reel the player towards the boss and blind them for {{Green|3}} seconds.

