Upon death, the '''Headless Horseman''' turns the ground under its death point to obsidian in a {{Green|2}} block radius.

A message is displayed in chat announcing to the server that it has been defeated, who dealt the final blow, the top 3 damagers, and the player's damage, position, and gained {{Skill|Runecrafting}} XP and Bits, similar to the message displayed when a boss dies. There is also a beacon that displays the location of the boss's defeat: its drops appear around the beacon in the obsidian radius.

