== Bugs ==
*When spawned during the [[Spooky Festival]], the '''Headless Horseman''' does not respect the player's [[mcw:Damage#Invulnerability timer|invincibility frames]], meaning it can kill them very quickly.
**This bug does not happen during the hour before and hour after the Spooky Festival while the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} is in the {{zone|Village}}.

== Trivia ==
[[File:Ujcs runic.png|thumb|Runic Headless Horseman]]
*The '''Headless Horseman''', unlike most other bosses, can spawn as [[Runic]]. Its runic version has only {{hp|10,000,000}} instead of the expected {{Hp|12,000,000}}.
*The '''Headless Horseman''' ''technically'' has a head; however, its head is a jack-o'-lantern, similar to its original appearance in [[w:The Legend of Sleepy Hollow|The Legend of Sleepy Hollow]], where the Headless Horseman originated.
*It was possible to use the Headless Horseman to remove {{Item|Bedrock}} on the player's {{zone|Private Island}} on {{gamemode|Stranded}}, but this was later patched.
* The '''Headless Horseman''' gives an average profit of {{BZC|1 Green Candy|1 Purple Candy|5 Spooky Fragment|-1 Horseman's Candle}} for the summoner, or {{BZC|3 Green Candy|3 Purple Candy|7 Spooky Fragment|-1 Horseman's Candle}} for a group of three.
** It therefore costs {{BZC|500 Horseman's Candle|-500 Green Candy|-500 Purple Candy|-2500 Spooky Fragment}} to complete the [[Bestiary]] alone, or {{BZC|500 Horseman's Candle|-1500 Green Candy|-1500 Purple Candy|-3500 Spooky Fragment}} as a group.

